Step 1: Connect to Your New Instance (Standard Port 22)
Once your new instance is running, connect to it

Connect to EC2 using default Port 22 and default 'ubuntu' user
ssh -i ~/.ssh/your-new-key.pem ubuntu@<NEW_INSTANCE_IP>

Step 2: Install Nginx
Once inside your new server, update package repositories and install Nginx:

# Update repository index and install Nginx
sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y nginx

# Verify Nginx is active and running
sudo systemctl status nginx --no-pager

